// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; T27 OS glass window -- the 27-petal home as a native macOS window, written in t27 and built by t27b.
; No HTML, no Swift: t27b compiles this module to an arm64 Mach-O object (`t27b build --macho`), and
; `ld` links it against AppKit, CoreGraphics, CoreText and libobjc. Every call into the system goes
; through an import, `fn f(..) T { return @extern("sym"); }` (t27b extern boundary, #8946).
//
; It behaves as the trios app does (BrowserOS/trios TriosTabView + QueenUI MainView, read 2026-10-19):
;   W  window   -- NSWindow 960 x 540 pt, transparent title bar, content = NSVisualEffectView, dark
;                  appearance, behind-window blending, black tint 0.30 (trios blackGlass nativeTint).
;   T  title    -- trios title bar, 34 pt: white template logo 22 x 18 + "TRINITY" (bold 12) = home,
;                  fullscreen control on the right, 1 pt white 0.14 divider under it. Starts right of
;                  the traffic lights (x >= 84).
;   H  home     -- the logo alone, centred in the area under the title bar at 0.63 of its height, in
;                  petal_menu's style (idle black 0.22, hover white, 1 px white outline), flying in as
;                  petal_glass.t27 does. Hovering a petal shows the trios tooltip: a white 0.94 pill,
;                  corner 6, 30 pt above the petal centre, "NAME  Cmd+1" in black semibold mono 13.
;   S  screen   -- a petal tap (or Cmd/Option/Control + 1..9, as QueenMenuShortcutPolicy) swaps the
;                  home for a full-area screen with an opacity cross-fade of 0.25 s (8 frames). Its
;                  32 pt navigation header (surface black 0.46 x 0.72) holds "< TRINITY" in green
;                  0x00FF88 (click, Escape or Cmd+0 = home), the world name centred (bold mono 13) and
;                  the 24 pt refresh circle on the right.
;   C  chat     -- the screen is trios' expanded chat workspace: a 272 pt sidebar (black 0.22) with the
;                  "New task" button (white 0.08, corner 9) and the queen card (yellow 0.07, edge 0.32),
;                  a white 0.14 x 0.7 divider, then the content (black 0.14) with a 44 pt header -- the
;                  sidebar toggle (28 x 28, or Cmd+Shift+S; collapses at once, no animation) and the
;                  title -- and the 3 x 3 card slots in a readable column of at most 900 pt.
;   D  dock     -- app icon: the logo white on a black squircle, drawn at launch.
; Not drawn (no server behind them yet): the Online dot, the "+" task button, search, swarm and
; history lists, Cmd+J / Cmd+K / Cmd+/ overlays, the formula in the tooltip.
; CoreGraphics rasterises (anti-aliased paths, CoreText lines) into a 2x bitmap that becomes the
; layer's contents. Epic gHashTag/t27#10782.

module T27osGlassWindow;

